==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|aerologies}}

# The branch of [[meteorology]] involving the [[observation]] of the [[atmosphere]] by means of [[balloon]]s, [[airplane]]s, etc.
# The [[study]] of the [[air]] and of the [[atmosphere]]. Used in the US Navy until early 1957. The same as meteorology; however, this usage tended to be more administrative than scientific.

====Related terms====
* [[aerologist]]
* [[aerological]]
* [[aerologic]]

